{
  "format": "loom.promptResource",
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "resourceKind": "setting",
  "rootNode": {
    "id": "official.loom-knowledge.setting",
    "label": "Loom Studio 基础知识",
    "meta": "Official Setting Layer",
    "category": "setting",
    "kind": "module",
    "body": "供官方问答助手使用的 Loom Studio 稳定基础知识。",
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "official.loom-knowledge.overview",
        "label": "平台概览",
        "meta": "始终加载",
        "category": "setting",
        "kind": "folder",
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "official.loom-knowledge.product",
            "label": "产品定位",
            "meta": "基础 · System",
            "category": "setting",
            "kind": "entry",
            "enabled": true,
            "body": "Loom Studio 是面向 AI 角色扮演与交互叙事创作的平台。它把提示词资源、叙事时间线和 Agent 工作会话分开管理，再由 PromptBuild 在运行时组合为模型输入。",
            "capabilities": { "activation": { "kind": "always" }, "targetAnchorId": "@setting.stable", "localDepth": 10, "roleHint": "system" }
          },
          {
            "id": "official.loom-knowledge.resources",
            "label": "核心资源",
            "meta": "基础 · System",
            "category": "setting",
            "kind": "entry",
            "enabled": true,
            "body": "Card 是可分享的启动包和资源清单；Preset 定义 Prompt 的 Zone、结构与排序；Setting Layer 保存世界设定和知识条目；Narrative Timeline 保存玩家看到的叙事正文；Agent Session 保存 Agent 自己的对话与工作历史。",
            "capabilities": { "activation": { "kind": "always" }, "targetAnchorId": "@setting.stable", "localDepth": 20, "roleHint": "system" }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "official.loom-knowledge.workflow-folder",
        "label": "创作工作流",
        "meta": "按需加载",
        "category": "setting",
        "kind": "folder",
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "official.loom-knowledge.workflow",
            "label": "基础工作流",
            "meta": "基础 · System",
            "category": "setting",
            "kind": "entry",
            "enabled": true,
            "body": "常见流程是创建或导入 Card，链接所需的 Preset 与 Setting Layer，从 Card 创建 Narrative Timeline，再选择 Agent 配置和模型开始对话。资源编辑与叙事游玩共享同一套后端数据能力。",
            "capabilities": { "activation": { "kind": "always" }, "targetAnchorId": "@setting.stable", "localDepth": 30, "roleHint": "system" }
          },
          {
            "id": "official.loom-knowledge.authoring",
            "label": "资源编排建议",
            "meta": "关键词 · User",
            "category": "setting",
            "kind": "entry",
            "enabled": true,
            "body": "资源应按作用域和用途组织。复杂资源保留专用编辑视图，包视图负责目录、来源和跳转，不重复承载完整编辑器。",
            "capabilities": { "activation": { "kind": "keyword", "keywords": ["资源", "编排", "Setting", "世界书"] }, "targetAnchorId": "@setting.reference", "localDepth": 40, "roleHint": "user" }
          },
          {
            "id": "official.loom-knowledge.experimental",
            "label": "实验功能",
            "meta": "默认关闭",
            "category": "setting",
            "kind": "folder",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "official.loom-knowledge.experimental-agents",
                "label": "多 Agent 协作",
                "meta": "关键词 · System",
                "category": "setting",
                "kind": "entry",
                "enabled": false,
                "body": "多 Agent 能力由扩展贡献 Agent Preset、工具和相关资源；具体运行时只加载当前调用链实际需要的部分。",
                "capabilities": { "activation": { "kind": "keyword", "keywords": ["Agent", "子 Agent", "多智能体"] }, "targetAnchorId": "@setting.reference", "localDepth": 50, "roleHint": "system" }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
